Matching 10 fill patterns would probably also be unsatisfactory. You
can probably get 4 (maybe 5) easily distinguished levels out of
scale_gray, e.g., white, light gray, dark gray, black. I think most
pattern fills would become pretty awful with more than 5 or five
patterns anyway.

