Hi,

I am trying to do a time series plot using a data frame d with `Time'
and `Value' columns but am getting an error:

  > li <- geom_line(aes(x=Time, y=Value))
  > ggplot(d) + li
  Error in cut.default(unclass(x), unclass(breaks), labels = labels,
    right = right, : cannot allocate vector of length 1293858001

Note that the above works if I eliminate the last row from d.

  > ggplot(d[-nrow(d),]) + li

I would appreciate any help.  My information and the definition of the
data frame are below.  (Data frame d is already much smaller than the
one I am actually working with.  It is the smallest subset that still
exhibits the problem.)

EdK

