Hi Adam,
You've already solved the first problem once (when you plotted the
historgram). Just do the same thing with the text geom:

geom_text(data=subset(tst,gender=="m"),stat="bin",aes(y=-..count..,
label=abs(-..count..)),hjust=1, format="comma")

As for problem 2, I'm not sure what you are trying to do. Non of your
values are over 1000, so I'm not sure what you expect comma() to do.

Best,
Ista

